00:37:36.340 --> 00:37:38.620
Just so I can get it out of the way, and give my opinions about the game.

00:37:38.760 --> 00:37:39.840
This game...

00:37:40.280 --> 00:37:45.280
As a fan of the original DOOM, there are some things that I would disagree with,

00:37:45.280 --> 00:37:49.880
and there's a lot of things that I would agree with.  Let me just start with what I agree with, obviously.

00:37:50.020 --> 00:37:55.500
I agree that this game is definitely reminiscent of what DOOM was.

00:37:55.500 --> 00:38:00.360
If they were setting out to set the stage of DOOM for what it was, for a new generation,

00:38:00.460 --> 00:38:05.080
I think they accomplished the goal in an enormous way.  It is a phenomenal game.

00:38:05.080 --> 00:38:12.740
It was phenomenally fun...the entire way through.  It had great feel to it.  It had the right, like, sense to it.

00:38:12.780 --> 00:38:21.660
It had everything right, in the right way, that it was just perfect...for that purpose, for recreating the feel.

00:38:21.660 --> 00:38:25.980
Not perfect overall, but recreating that feel, I think they nailed it.

00:38:25.980 --> 00:38:30.160
A hundred percent nailed the brutality of it, the victoriousness of it,

00:38:30.160 --> 00:38:35.820
the unstoppable nature of this DOOM guy, that sets him...to what we've always known!

00:38:35.820 --> 00:38:41.640
DOOM guy is a b--...like, a...guy to, like--there's NO stopping DOOM guy.

00:38:41.640 --> 00:38:47.660
Like, it's unbelievable how much, like...fuckin' destruction this guy brings,

00:38:47.660 --> 00:38:50.260
and it was just sooo good to channel that through the game.

00:38:50.260 --> 00:38:53.500
Now... Level design-wise, also good.

00:38:53.500 --> 00:39:00.560
It felt very, uh, interesting with...y'know, the UAC and Hell, although I will admit, Hell started to get very samey.

00:39:00.560 --> 00:39:04.620
For as, like, diverse and faceted as it was it was very easy to get lost.

00:39:04.620 --> 00:39:06.460
'Cause everything kinda looked the same.

00:39:06.460 --> 00:39:09.780
But, maybe that was the point, 'cause the level design was supposed to be very open.

00:39:09.780 --> 00:39:14.240
And I kinda agree with that, that should be emphasized, and I like that because...

00:39:14.880 --> 00:39:20.280
It allowed you to take your own path through the game, and it allowed you to, uh, decide what to do first.

00:39:20.280 --> 00:39:22.000
If you wanted to go do the secrets, you could do that.

00:39:22.000 --> 00:39:25.980
If you just wanna go play through the game and get to the end, you could do that too.

00:39:26.160 --> 00:39:30.900
Still fun, no matter what.  You play the way you wanna play, even though you ta--you take your set pieces-*burp*

00:39:31.200 --> 00:39:33.180
But in those set pieces, you do what you wanna do.

00:39:33.180 --> 00:39:38.280
Now... Wh-what I would...l-have liked to have seen more out of this game...

00:39:38.380 --> 00:39:40.600
Is some more...

00:39:42.040 --> 00:39:43.760
story innovation.

00:39:43.840 --> 00:39:48.560
Ah--i-i--ah-i--okay...I-I'm always very hesitant about criticism, because I wanna be--

00:39:48.560 --> 00:39:53.020
I wanna make sure that I'm not misunderstood on what I think is wrong with the game, and--

00:39:53.020 --> 00:39:57.640
and, I'm not saying anything is wrong with the game.  I don't think I could've done something better.

00:39:57.640 --> 00:39:59.260
But, what I would've liked to see is...

00:39:59.400 --> 00:40:04.280
We all know DOOM.  Like, we know it.  Wh-fans of DOOM, we know DOOM.  And this is DOOM.

00:40:04.360 --> 00:40:05.600
Definitely DOOM, it's great.

00:40:05.600 --> 00:40:07.320
That's adorable, that's frickin' cute.  XD

00:40:07.520 --> 00:40:08.140
But...

00:40:09.780 --> 00:40:18.760
I don't feel like they added more, and I don't feel like they connected the set pieces from what has come before...

00:40:19.260 --> 00:40:21.960
What they went for was just a recreation of DOOM,

00:40:21.960 --> 00:40:26.600
and to reinvigorate the series and bring it to the next generation.  And they did that, like I said...

00:40:27.020 --> 00:40:29.700
Thaaat is kick-ass!  =D That is killer!

00:40:29.700 --> 00:40:30.820
That is awesome.

00:40:30.820 --> 00:40:35.240
That...that's--oh, yeah.  You gotta do that, I've seen that outta the trailer, but...damn.

00:40:35.480 --> 00:40:40.560
