00:40:40.560 --> 00:40:44.000
I mean, obviously they had...y'know, the new characters,

00:40:44.000 --> 00:40:47.400
and like, the motivation, but that was all to drive the story of what was in here.

00:40:47.400 --> 00:40:50.720
What I wanted was more...of the why.

00:40:50.720 --> 00:40:54.960
