00:40:54.960 --> 00:40:59.080
And who--Who gave him the armor?  Who did all this stuff??  Who-wh-who was all this??

00:40:59.080 --> 00:41:04.000
Like, there's...there's a lot of unanswered questions, and I-I bet they're...what they're doing is...

00:41:04.380 --> 00:41:07.940
Kinda like what Star Wars: The Aw--uh, The Force Awakens did.

00:41:07.940 --> 00:41:17.440
They created kind of a recreation of Episode IV...to open up for more.

00:41:17.440 --> 00:41:25.480
So, this is like the reintroduction of DOOM, so that they can expand it more in the sequels that are to come.

00:41:25.480 --> 00:41:32.220
And I would love to see sequels, but at the same time...I feel like they could have had more in this one...

00:41:32.220 --> 00:41:37.040
Instead of waiting for the next ones.  But, they have a whole new generation to try to open this up to.

00:41:37.040 --> 00:41:39.760
I am an old fan.  Of course I want more.

00:41:39.760 --> 00:41:45.720
That's who I am, I've been...like, eagerly awaiting this type of game to come out for 20 years, so...

00:41:45.720 --> 00:41:49.980
Of course I'm not gonna be satisfied.  That's where my bias comes into play,

00:41:49.980 --> 00:41:55.080
and I'm not entirely right in saying that, so...because of my perspective.

00:41:55.080 --> 00:41:59.960
From a new character coming into this...or, new character--a new player coming into this, this is amazing.

00:41:59.960 --> 00:42:05.000
And this is so much fun.  And, oddly, it's different from what's out there right now in the shooter world.

00:42:05.000 --> 00:42:06.360
But that's a good thing.

00:42:06.360 --> 00:42:12.200
